; [move-elements-to-editor] The parchment button faces used to be four
; StyleBoxFlats built in _apply_parchment_styles(). They are overrides on this
; node now, so the card's paper colour, its gold rim and its corner radius are
; all inspector work. Local overrides on purpose: ONLY these three cards go
; parchment, every other Button in the game keeps the global blue theme.

