; Icon and Pips keep a _draw() callback in upgrade_button.gd - the medallion is
; per-upgrade and the pip row is per-level, neither of which the inspector can
; express - but their BOXES live here, so where the medallion sits and how wide
; the pip row runs are both editor work. Pips hangs off the bottom anchor, so
; the card survives the tray handing it a different height.

[node name="Icon" type="Control" parent="."]
